From 3714315aa45912a968d9143a1a5473a2b54b7e00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 22:34:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Damage Calculator tab

- New skills + skill_stats tables (owner-managed skills, each with a title, description, sub element, and any number of stats)
- Stats are either scaling (value = base + strength * scale) or static (fixed value)
- New /damage-calculator page: strength input at top auto-updates all scaling stats live, search box, skills grouped and color-coded by sub element (Base, Lava, Metal, Sand)
- Site owner only sees add/edit/delete controls for skills
